199| \begin{theorem}[分离度方程]\label{thm:b2:chromatography:resolution}
200| 对于理论塔板数相同均为 $N$ 的两个相邻峰，
201| \begin{equation*}
202| R_s = \frac{\sqrt N}{4}\,\frac{\alpha - 1}{\alpha}\,\frac{k_2}{1 + k_2}.
203| \end{equation*}
204| \end{theorem}
205| 
206| \begin{proof}
207| 对于靠得很近的两峰，两者的基线宽度近似相等，取二者均等于第二峰的宽度，
208| $w = 4\sigma_t = 4t_{R2}/\sqrt N$（见\cref{def:b2:chromatography:plates}）。于是 $R_s = (t_{R2} -
209| t_{R1})/w = \sqrt N\,(t_{R2} - t_{R1})/(4t_{R2})$。由 $t_R = t_M(1 + k)$
210| （见\cref{prop:b2:chromatography:retention-time}）可知 $t_{R2} - t_{R1} = t_M(k_2 - k_1)$，$t_{R2} =
211| t_M(1 + k_2)$，故 $R_s = (\sqrt N/4)(k_2 - k_1)/(1 + k_2)$。最后，$k_2 - k_1 = k_2(1 - 1/\alpha) =
212| k_2(\alpha - 1)/\alpha$。
213| \end{proof}
